API.md §5.7: a legacy-prefix finding whose suggested name is free has one edit request, a
renameName to that name, and linting again after the request applies reports nothing.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- apply --
-- m/m.canon --
package m

record Unit {
  dwHealth: Int
}
-- findings.txt --
warning[W0001]  m/m.canon:4:3
  field dwHealth keeps the legacy prefix dw in its Canon name: rename it health (canon rename keeps the old wire name with @json where a load or a data emit reads the field)

0 errors, 1 warning in 1 package (…)
fix W0001 m/m.canon:4:3 {"ops":[{"op":"renameName","path":"m:Unit.dwHealth","name":"health"}]}
after the first fix:
0 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
